{
  "_readme": [
    "Blog configuration: what a form's values become on the way to disk, and",
    "which of them are refused.",
    "",
    "normalizeBlog has two quirks a tidier implementation would lose, and both",
    "are pinned here: an empty live path becomes \"//\", and an interior double",
    "slash is left exactly as written. Neither is a good answer; both are the",
    "answer the other backend gives, and a blog whose paths changed shape",
    "under one of them would push posts somewhere else.",
    "",
    "The repo pattern is [\\w.-]+/[\\w.-]+, and \\w without the u flag is",
    "ASCII - so café/repo is not a repository name.",
    "",
    "Run: pnpm run test (TypeScript) and cargo test (Rust). Both read this."
  ],
